sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Dentist
  participant UI as Treatment Screen
  participant S as TreatmentDossierService
  participant DB as Database
  D ->> UI : proceed to treatment after the examination
  UI ->> S : createDossier(patient, branch, diagnosis, sourceVisit)
  activate S
  S ->> S : user is a dentist of the branch?
  S ->> DB : patient exists?
  S ->> DB : find stored result of this request
  alt request was already processed
  S -->> UI : return stored result
  else new request
  S ->> S : validate diagnosis and note
  S ->> DB : dentist works in the branch?
  S ->> DB : load source visit, check version unchanged
  S ->> DB : load confirmed examination of that visit
  S ->> DB : create dossier with examination snapshot
  S ->> DB : save history events and request record
  S -->> UI : new dossier and success message
  end
  deactivate S
